    "text": "A capacitor of capacitance <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>100</mn><mo> </mo><mi>μF</mi></math> is charged to a potential of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>12</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math> and connected to a <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn><mo> </mo><mi>mH</mi></math> inductor to produce oscillations. The maximum current in the circuit would be :"
